  "body": "MINOR `4.23.1` → `4.24.0`.\n\n## 1. Cached input never recorded — and it was my capture, not the mapping\n\nYou were right that it still didn't work. I traced it properly this time.\n\nAnthropic-native upstreams report cache counters on **`message_start`**, so that's the only place my capture looked. Everything translated from an **OpenAI-shaped** provider learns them from the final usage chunk, which arrives on **`message_delta`** — so the value was extracted correctly by the provider and then discarded by the recorder.\n\n**Proven against live OpenRouter**, a repeated 4k-token prompt:\n\n```\nOpenRouter usage    : prompt_tokens 4011, prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens 3968\nprovider maps to    : {'cache_read_input_tokens': 3968}\nrecorded tokens_in  : 4011\nrecorded cache_read : 3968          ← previously recorded as nothing\n```\n\nThat's a **98.9% hit rate** that was showing as zero. Both event shapes now have regression tests.\n\nWorth noting OpenRouter also returns `cache_write_tokens` inside `prompt_tokens_details` (not as a separate Anthropic-style field) and a real `cost` in dollars — neither is consumed yet, but both are now visible as follow-ups.\n\n## 2. The Guide page was thin next to the README\n\nMostly because it had **no images**. Seven screenshots now ship inside the package, served from a new `/admin/img` route.\n\nSecurity detail: the route matches the requested name against **the files actually bundled** rather than joining it onto a path, so a crafted filename can't traverse out. A test asserts every image the Guide references is bundled, and that traversal strings aren't in the name set.\n\nThe Guide is rewritten to match the written guide's depth: step-by-step **Claude Code** and **Claude Desktop** tutorials with their screenshots and field tables, the validation-failure table, model tier advice, web search including full page text, how to read the cache columns, rotation, updating, and a security section covering what binds where.\n\n12 sections, 12 anchors, 7 images — all verified present.\n\n## Verification\n\n```\nguide images referenced : 7\nmissing image files     : none\nTOC anchors / headings  : 12 / 12\nbundled images in wheel : 7\n```\n\nFull suite passes except the 14 failures that also fail on unmodified `main`.\n\n## Residual risks\n\nThe bundled screenshots add ~940 KB to the wheel. They're also a second copy of the images in `assets/`, so a future screenshot refresh has to update both — worth a build step if that becomes annoying.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
